# Normalise line endings in the repo, check out native.
# Without this every file shows as modified on a machine with the other convention.
* text=auto
# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
# The models and the station geometry are stored gzipped (tools/pack.cjs,
# 2026-10-30), in plain git. They were in Git LFS until then; LFS stored
# them uncompressed and counted every byte against the quota.
*.gz binary
*.glb binary
